# Private data
# Strings the packaging script must keep out of a release. Local to this
# machine: publishing the list would leak what it exists to protect.
tools/forbidden.local.txt

# Markdown documents: they stay local, outside the repository.
# Two are kept for people arriving from outside: README.md, the official
# documentation of the public project, and CONTRIBUTING.md, which holds the
# rules for contributing. Everything else, working context included, stays on
# disk.
*.md
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
